OL,3,GNEWSASuits sleep rough in honour of
OL,4,Afilm-maker's passion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sudden death of a film-maker 13
OL,7,Fyears ago prompted Abu Ali to carry on
OL,8,Fhis friend's fight against
OL,9,Fhomelessness. Now the chairman of the
OL,10,FCEO Sleepout charity, which sees
OL,11,Fcorporate high-flyers spend nights
OL,12,Fsleeping rough, he remembers the man
OL,13,Fwhose passion really started it.
OL,15,FAli was working in corporate finance in
OL,16,F2013 when his best friend Lee Halpin
OL,17,Fdied of sudden adult death syndrome
OL,18,Fduring his third day filming a
OL,19,Fhomelessness documentary in Newcastle.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
