OL,3,GNEWSASuits sleep rough in honour of
OL,4,Afilm-maker's passion
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the shock news, Ali watched
OL,7,Fsome of the footage his friend had
OL,8,Fcaptured while "immersed" in homeless
OL,9,Flife.
OL,11,F"I'll be honest, it wasn't something I
OL,12,Fhad paid a huge amount of interest to,"
OL,13,Fhe said.
